{meta title='Letters, sets and logic', about='Greek letters by their names, the double-struck sets, relations, arrows and quantifiers - a formula with braces stands between the tags, where they are taken as written.'/}
<p>{math 'AA epsilon > 0, EE delta > 0 : |x - a| < delta => |f(x) - f(a)| < epsilon'/}</p>
<p>{math 'NN sub ZZ sub QQ sub RR sub CC'/} &middot; {math}A nn B = {x | x in A and x in B}{/math}</p>
<p>{math 'Delta x ~~ 0.01, quad alpha + beta + gamma = pi, quad x != y, quad a <= b'/}</p>
